1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,065
Beyond Earth, monitoring astronaut health
becomes a critical mission challenge.

2
00:00:04,435 --> 00:00:09,044
Meet ASTRA VITAL, an intelligent health
monitoring prototype by NYXARA NOVA.

3
00:00:09,414 --> 00:00:14,812
It helps crew members track health indicators,
understand trends, and identify concerning changes.

4
00:00:15,182 --> 00:00:19,936
An explainable alert engine connects health
monitoring with NASA's five spaceflight hazards.

5
00:00:20,306 --> 00:00:26,022
Offline-first records support continuity,
alongside documented Inspiration4 research data.

6
00:00:26,392 --> 00:00:27,055
ASTRA VITAL.

7
00:00:27,075 --> 00:00:29,160
Protecting human health beyond Earth.
